<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Fan analytics · {{ project_name|e }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Illustrative sample-data analytics for Starsilk Compendium fans: visits, readers, dwell, completions, collections, and top folios.">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url|e }}"><link rel="alternate" type="application/json" href="analytics.json"><link rel="stylesheet" href="analytics.css">
</head>
<body class="ana-body" data-museum-shell="unified">
<a class="ana-skip" href="#anaMain">Skip to dashboard</a>
{% set nav_root = '../' %}{% set nav_current = 'analytics' %}{% include "_museum_nav.html.j2" %}
<div class="ana-page">
<header class="ana-hero">
<p class="ana-eyebrow">Fan analytics · Compendium pulse</p>
<h1>How fans wander the archive</h1>
<p class="ana-lede">An interactive look at visits, readers, dwell time, and favorite folios across the Starsilk Compendium. Every number below is <strong>illustrative sample data</strong> generated for this demo &mdash; nothing is tracked or measured from real readers.</p>
<div class="ana-meta">
<span class="ana-badge"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sample data</span>
<span class="ana-generated">Sample window {{ start_date|e }} to {{ end_date|e }} · <a href="analytics.json">analytics.json</a> · <a href="analytics.md">methodology</a> · <a href="AUTHORITY.md">authority</a></span>
<button class="ana-theme" id="anaTheme" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">☾</span><span class="label">Light mode</span></button>
</div>
</header>
<main id="anaMain">
<div class="ana-filters" role="group" aria-label="Dashboard filters">
<div class="ana-filters-row">
<div class="ana-field"><span id="rangeLabel">Date range</span>
<div class="ana-segmented" role="group" aria-labelledby="rangeLabel">
<button type="button" data-preset="7d" aria-pressed="false">7D</button><button type="button" data-preset="30d" aria-pressed="true">30D</button><button type="button" data-preset="90d" aria-pressed="false">90D</button><button type="button" data-preset="all" aria-pressed="false">All</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ana-field"><span id="customLabel">Custom range</span>
<div class="ana-dates" role="group" aria-labelledby="customLabel">
<label class="sr-only" for="anaFrom">Start date</label><input type="date" id="anaFrom" name="from" min="{{ start_date|e }}" max="{{ end_date|e }}">
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<label class="sr-only" for="anaTo">End date</label><input type="date" id="anaTo" name="to" min="{{ start_date|e }}" max="{{ end_date|e }}">
<button class="ana-apply" id="anaApply" type="button">Apply</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ana-field ana-select"><span id="segmentLabel">Reader segment</span>
<select id="anaSegment" aria-labelledby="segmentLabel">
<option value="all">All segments</option>
{% for segment in segments %}<option value="{{ segment.id|e }}">{{ segment.label|e }}</option>
{% endfor %}</select>
</div>
<div class="ana-field"><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><button class="ana-reset" id="anaReset" type="button">Reset</button></div>
</div>
<p class="ana-status" id="anaStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading sample data…</p>
<p class="ana-error" id="anaError" role="alert" hidden></p>
</div>

<section class="ana-section" aria-labelledby="kpiHeading">
<div class="ana-section-head"><h2 id="kpiHeading">At a glance</h2><p>Totals for the selected range and segment, with trend vs the prior equivalent window.</p></div>
<div class="ana-kpis">
<div class="ana-card ana-kpi" data-kpi="visits" style="--kpi-accent:#55dfff"><p class="ana-kpi-label">Compendium visits</p><p class="ana-kpi-value">—</p><p class="ana-kpi-sub"><span class="ana-delta flat">—</span><span>trend</span></p><svg class="ana-kpi-spark" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div>
<div class="ana-card ana-kpi" data-kpi="readers" style="--kpi-accent:#b48cff"><p class="ana-kpi-label">Active readers</p><p class="ana-kpi-value">—</p><p class="ana-kpi-sub"><span class="ana-delta flat">—</span><span>trend</span></p><svg class="ana-kpi-spark" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div>
<div class="ana-card ana-kpi" data-kpi="dwell" style="--kpi-accent:#7ee2a8"><p class="ana-kpi-label">Avg. dwell time</p><p class="ana-kpi-value">—</p><p class="ana-kpi-sub"><span class="ana-delta flat">—</span><span>trend</span></p><svg class="ana-kpi-spark" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div>
<div class="ana-card ana-kpi" data-kpi="completions" style="--kpi-accent:#ffd166"><p class="ana-kpi-label">Folios completed</p><p class="ana-kpi-value">—</p><p class="ana-kpi-sub"><span class="ana-delta flat">—</span><span>trend</span></p><svg class="ana-kpi-spark" aria-hidden="true"></svg></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ana-section" aria-labelledby="chartsHeading">
<div class="ana-section-head"><h2 id="chartsHeading">Engagement over time</h2><p>Hover any chart for details. Every view follows the filters above.</p></div>
<div class="ana-charts">
<div class="ana-card ana-chart wide"><div class="ana-chart-head"><h3>Daily visits &amp; readers</h3><p>toggle a series to isolate it</p></div>
<div class="ana-legend" id="lineLegend"><button type="button" data-series="visits" aria-pressed="true" style="--sw:var(--ana-line-visits)"><span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span>Visits</button><button type="button" data-series="readers" aria-pressed="true" style="--sw:var(--ana-line-readers)"><span class="swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span>Readers</button></div>
<svg class="ana-svg" id="lineChart" role="img" aria-label="Daily visits and readers"></svg>
</div>
<div class="ana-card ana-chart"><div class="ana-chart-head"><h3>Views by collection</h3><p>folio views in range</p></div>
<svg class="ana-svg" id="barChart" role="img" aria-label="Views by collection"></svg>
</div>
<div class="ana-card ana-chart"><div class="ana-chart-head"><h3>Reader mix</h3><p>visit share by segment</p></div>
<div class="ana-donut-wrap"><svg class="ana-svg ana-donut-svg" id="donutChart" role="img" aria-label="Visit share by reader segment"></svg><ul class="ana-donut-legend" id="donutLegend"></ul></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ana-section" aria-labelledby="tableHeading">
<div class="ana-section-head"><h2 id="tableHeading">Top folios</h2><p>Sort any column, search, or narrow by collection. Folio names link to their records.</p></div>
<div class="ana-table-toolbar">
<div class="ana-field ana-search"><span id="searchLabel">Search folios</span><input type="search" id="folioSearch" aria-labelledby="searchLabel" placeholder="Search folios…" autocomplete="off"></div>
<div class="ana-field ana-select"><span id="collectionLabel">Collection</span>
<select id="folioCollection" aria-labelledby="collectionLabel">
<option value="all">All collections</option>
{% for collection in collections %}<option value="{{ collection.id|e }}">{{ collection.label|e }}</option>
{% endfor %}</select>
</div>
<button class="ana-export" id="folioExport" type="button">Download CSV</button>
<span class="ana-table-meta" id="folioCount" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
</div>
<div class="ana-table-scroll">
<table class="ana-table">
<caption>Per-folio engagement for the selected range and segment. Trend compares the second half of the range to the first.</caption>
<thead><tr>
<th scope="col"><button type="button" data-sort="folio">Folio <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></th>
<th scope="col" class="num"><button type="button" data-sort="views">Views <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></th>
<th scope="col" class="num"><button type="button" data-sort="readers">Readers <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></th>
<th scope="col" class="num"><button type="button" data-sort="dwell">Avg dwell <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></th>
<th scope="col" class="num"><button type="button" data-sort="completion">Completion <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></th>
<th scope="col" class="num"><button type="button" data-sort="trend">Trend <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody id="folioBody"><tr><td colspan="6" class="ana-empty">Loading sample data…</td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>

<footer class="ana-foot">
<h2>About these numbers</h2>
<p>All figures are <strong>deterministic sample data</strong> generated from <code>src/analytics/dashboard.json</code> (seed {{ seed|e }}) by <code>build/analytics_publication.py</code>. They illustrate dashboard behavior only and must never be quoted as real readership, canon, or publication evidence.</p>
<p>Aggregation is view-only: range sums, per-day trend deltas, segment affinity weighting, and table sorting change the rendered view without altering the published <code>analytics.json</code>. The page sets no tracking cookies and stores only a browser-local theme preference.</p>
<p><a href="../">Back to the Starsilk Compendium</a></p>
</footer>
</main>
</div>
<script src="analytics.js"></script>
</body></html>
